{"html":"\n    <div class=\"rdx-deckwrap\"><div class=\"rdx-deck\">\n      <div class=\"rdx-label\">Rules</div><button type=\"button\" class=\"rdx-tile k-alpha\" style=\"grid-row: span 4\" data-ex=\"alpha\" aria-pressed=\"false\" title=\"rename a binder\"><span class=\"rdx-face\" aria-hidden=\"true\">α</span><b>alpha</b><span class=\"rdx-sub\">rename a binder</span><code>λx. t ≡ λy. t[x:=y]</code></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"rdx-tile k-beta on\" style=\"grid-row: span 4\" data-ex=\"beta\" aria-pressed=\"true\" title=\"apply a function\"><span class=\"rdx-face\" aria-hidden=\"true\">β</span><b>beta</b><span class=\"rdx-sub\">apply a function</span><code>(λx. t) s ⟶ t[x:=s]</code></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"rdx-tile k-eta\" style=\"grid-row: span 4\" data-ex=\"eta\" aria-pressed=\"false\" title=\"drop a wrapper\"><span class=\"rdx-face\" aria-hidden=\"true\">η</span><b>eta</b><span class=\"rdx-sub\">drop a wrapper</span><code>λx. f x ⟶ f</code></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"rdx-tile k-delta\" style=\"grid-row: span 4\" data-ex=\"delta\" aria-pressed=\"false\" title=\"unfold a definition\"><span class=\"rdx-face\" aria-hidden=\"true\">δ</span><b>delta</b><span class=\"rdx-sub\">unfold a definition</span><code>c ⟶ body of c</code></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"rdx-tile k-zeta\" style=\"grid-row: span 4\" data-ex=\"zeta\" aria-pressed=\"false\" title=\"inline a let\"><span class=\"rdx-face\" aria-hidden=\"true\">ζ</span><b>zeta</b><span class=\"rdx-sub\">inline a let</span><code>let x := v; t ⟶ t[x:=v]</code></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"rdx-tile k-iota\" style=\"grid-row: span 4\" data-ex=\"iota\" aria-pressed=\"false\" title=\"eliminate a constructor\"><span class=\"rdx-face\" aria-hidden=\"true\">ι</span><b>iota</b><span class=\"rdx-sub\">eliminate a constructor</span><code>Nat.rec z s (succ n) ⟶ s n (Nat.rec z s n)</code></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"rdx-tile k-proj\" style=\"grid-row: span 4\" data-e